## Rules
- NEVER modify files. Read-only.
- NEVER guess — if you cannot find evidence, say "Could not find evidence of X".
- ALWAYS check cross-module/cross-service impact.
- ALWAYS report shared library / package impacts.
- ALWAYS report existing test coverage for affected areas.
